# Leave VITE_JOURNAL unset for development: `npm run dev` serves both journals and the tabs at the top switch between them
# (/ijmat is Journal 1, /jimrt is Journal 2, /ijcsd is Journal 3).
# Set it only for a single-journal build (the build:j1 / build:j2 scripts do this for you): j1 (IJMAT), j2 (JIMRT) or j3 (IJCSD).
# VITE_JOURNAL=

# Optional, single-journal builds only: where the journal tabs link to. Defaults are https://ijmat.org, https://jimrt.org and https://ijcsd.org.
# VITE_URL_J1=
# VITE_URL_J2=
# VITE_URL_J3=
